WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:03.330
- If you're hungry,
there is no better city

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:05.900
in India to find a snack than Mumbai.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.700
With over 20 million residents,

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.963
the city is constantly on the move.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:13.591
It's loud, crowded, and full of flavor.

00:00:13.591 --> 00:00:14.690
(water sizzling)

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.510
Every street corner is a chance

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.424
to taste something fantastic.

00:00:18.424 --> 00:00:21.370
(bright music)

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.680
North of the center, in
a quieter neighborhood

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.340
called Borivali, you'll find

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.503
a sandwich stand that is one of a kind,

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.271
and definitely worth the 300 rupee ride.

00:00:31.271 --> 00:00:33.854
(upbeat music)

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:41.033
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:32.257 --> 00:01:34.860
Great things come in pairs,
and it just so happens

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.010
that around the corner from Kunal's stand

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:39.000
is another exceptional spot.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.593
It's a traditional Indian puri
dish, completely re-imagined.

00:01:45.656 --> 00:01:49.573
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:44.100
Back near city center, just
down the road from Juhu Beach

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.708
is a stand that is elevating
a dish every Indian knows.

00:02:47.708 --> 00:02:50.291
(upbeat music)

00:02:51.146 --> 00:02:55.063
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.870
If you head east and cross
Sanjay National Park,

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:51.130
you'll emerge on a newer side of Mumbai.

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:52.940
There isn't much happening culturally,

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:56.433
but there is a dish you
won't find anywhere else.

00:03:58.764 --> 00:04:02.681
(speaking in foreign language)

00:04:43.657 --> 00:04:46.240
(upbeat music)

